"Shortcuts" = "Shortcuts";
"In the Shortcuts app, create a personal automation — when the iPhone connects to power, at a time of day, or when it joins your home Wi-Fi — set it to run immediately, and add Back Up Photos. Each run has about 30 seconds: it finds new photos in the selected albums and hands them to iOS to upload in the background. It runs even with Automatic Backup off, and still follows Use Connection and Pause. Photos stored only in iCloud wait until the app is open." = "In the Shortcuts app, create a personal automation — when the iPhone connects to power, at a time of day, or when it joins your home Wi-Fi — set it to run immediately, and add Back Up Photos. Each run has about 30 seconds: it finds new photos in the selected albums and hands them to iOS to upload in the background. It runs even with Automatic Backup off, and still follows Use Connection and Pause. Photos stored only in iCloud wait until the app is open.";
